{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "254efb507516e906017bd9efa484d32a6e3cab983d6d26833ce26b0974f43dc0", "ja": "クエスト4：お菓子作りを成功させよう！", "zh": "任务4：成功做出甜点吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "78f4cf94ed08016079bebcb11c2eaff8925b9d688e704ef3d072c73b7aa4323f", "ja": "三女でパティシエ役の杏奈は、お菓子が上手\nに作れず、悩んでいた。すっかり落ち込んで\nしまっていた杏奈だったが、プロデューサー\nのアドバイスで、お菓子作りをゲームだと\n考えることで、上手く作れるようになる。", "zh": "饰演三女，同时也是甜点师的杏奈，\n因为做不好甜点一直在烦恼。\n杏奈虽然因此陷入低潮，\n但制作人建议她把做甜点当成游戏来看，\n让她终于成功做出好吃的甜点。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "123df08ceb7a488c613e92a347f285fef028eb6e5b5d3d36cad0386d902d0fe0", "ja": "（グッズに使う写真の選別が、やっと終わったぞ。\nさて、次の仕事は……）", "zh": "（终于挑完要用来当周边的照片了。\n下一个工作是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1001_024ann", "source_sha256": "d069fe3be526052fa67b7a9ab7e5e37b0b5a15455d702c1e09c67e2973631d3a", "ja": "すー……すー……。\n……ビビッと、お菓子……作っちゃう、よ……。", "zh": "呼……呼……\n……要充满活力地，开始……做甜点，啰……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1002_p", "source_sha256": "ce441f724e1b178f5b4bb96b0459d42a55e6378a06e29509acbd135ccd8dc558", "ja": "ん？　……杏奈、こんなとこで寝ちゃったのか。\n周りに落ちてるのは……お菓子作りのレシピ？", "zh": "嗯？杏奈，你怎么睡在这啊？\n旁边散落一地的是……甜点的食谱？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1003_p", "source_sha256": "08cebb81734c86e053b7b3aa08d5fa28aa36d432c5d75e8906052ae8266c64d6", "ja": "おーい、杏奈。\nこんなところで寝てると風邪ひくぞ、起きろー。", "zh": "喂～杏奈，\n你睡在这里会感冒的，快起来～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1004_024ann", "source_sha256": "138b1f449111a5d1aafee9929bd8212dcd085445c67ab690087c13865820c11e", "ja": "ん……{$P$}、さん……？\n杏奈……今、変な夢、見た……。", "zh": "嗯……{$P$}，先生……？\n杏奈……刚刚，做了，奇怪的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1005_024ann", "source_sha256": "f0aefee2ebbf444b5ca34537c38f7543241b1e8548cdeb4e94af5c1d429cdd2f", "ja": "妖精の……ジュリアさんと、一緒に……\nお菓子作りの、冒険に出る……夢……。", "zh": "杏奈和妖精……茱莉亚，一起……\n踏上制作甜点的，冒险旅程……的梦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1006_p", "source_sha256": "650862fb59f822bb3ba230b02557c10e9a9e7bc24e2fa17f7a83d4c36ff7a158", "ja": "それは変な夢だな……『三姉妹カフェ』でパティシエの\n役を演じるから、そういう夢を見たのかもな。", "zh": "还真是怪梦一个……可能是因为你要演\n《三姊妹咖啡厅》里的甜点师，才会做这样的梦吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1007_024ann", "source_sha256": "06b4a49fc1f742f583017557ffe6ddab2f7a16c9fc7e2a19e525ff0f18281d48", "ja": "うん……そうかも……。", "zh": "嗯……可能是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1008_024ann", "source_sha256": "6cba4e4eb72f961aaf3de028d96933bf0770ea31a12c8de9938fb7ed2bdf5150", "ja": "えっと……{$P$}さん。\n杏奈、ちょっと……困ってることが、あります……。", "zh": "那个……{$P$}先生，\n杏奈，觉得……有点，伤脑筋……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1009_p", "source_sha256": "9aca34c00760626cf39b8371fc434d04701d30dd84eb8a2e750b6701ef9615e0", "ja": "困っていること？", "zh": "伤脑筋？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1010_024ann", "source_sha256": "3508c843dc0bf143d5b63177b573a65c65b59b27128257eff5360acbfa5cf948", "ja": "杏奈の役の、三奈……シフォンケーキが得意……。\nそれで、春香さんから作り方習った……けど……。", "zh": "杏奈演的角色，三奈……擅长做戚风蛋糕……\n所以杏奈去找春香学了作法……可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1011_024ann", "source_sha256": "ea7f8a7c6560e5b05ff23143634423d680bba747cc684103bfa0d1f1e9e2266d", "ja": "何回練習しても、杏奈……シフォンケーキ……\n上手に、ふくらんでくれなくて……。", "zh": "不管杏奈，尝试几次……都没办法……\n让戚风蛋糕，膨胀起来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1012_024ann", "source_sha256": "43e790b27154687abba17729b1d42c55430b9cdfff23642a09ed14e3464352a5", "ja": "このままだと、杏奈……三奈のこと、\nちゃんと演じられない……かも……。", "zh": "这样下去，杏奈……会演不好，\n三奈这个角色……也说不定……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1013_p", "source_sha256": "276976558bded68a9507c55838b436ce8fe70d153add41880842fbfeb86b8c09", "ja": "（杏奈、少し落ちこんでしまってるみたいだな……。\nそれだけ、役と真剣に向き合ってるという事だけど）", "zh": "（杏奈好像有点失落的样子……\n这就代表她有多认真在面对这个角色。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6f0ba976e93bc1625340ffad77d5a36a943c4aa62031b787dfeac54f7d0b882a", "ja": "心配しなくても大丈夫だ、杏奈！　練習すれば、\n必ず上手に、シフォンケーキを作れるようになるよ。", "zh": "用不着担心，杏奈！只要好好练习，\n你一定也能做出漂亮的戚风蛋糕。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1015_024ann", "source_sha256": "7021c2b5f18d1451c6d0911fb0e2c35106825756d657439008fd66eaff4eb742", "ja": "{$P$}さん……本当に……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……真的吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1016_p", "source_sha256": "ff8478aefbdf2af5199c9213d3dd839c74a0be3ce997964139c1a4c423da3b98", "ja": "ああ。静香もオムライスの作り方で悩んでたけど、\nちゃんと練習して、上手に作れるようになった。", "zh": "是啊，静香原本也在烦恼怎么做蛋包饭，\n但经过一番练习以后，她已经能做出漂亮的蛋包饭了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1017_p", "source_sha256": "0fd4c44a59873c1f863993d1817a094669ad63d68d9a71930f018a1de45a1640", "ja": "杏奈も練習を重ねれば、美味しいシフォンケーキが\n作れるようになるさ。練習、付き合うよ。", "zh": "只要杏奈勤加练习，肯定能做出好吃的戚风蛋糕。\n我来陪你练习吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1018_024ann", "source_sha256": "777322d8b18c1169b689a074e90511d61f27dadcfab6e9041c4bdc79bed72aa3", "ja": "{$P$}さん……ありがとう……。\nよろしく、お願いします……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生……谢谢你……\n万事，拜托了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1019_p", "source_sha256": "e047add61b957d1238c8aca96e5d9457311c9757453466c4ad3f58858b13d816", "ja": "さて……それじゃあ早速だけど、\nまずはいつも通りに作ってみてくれないか？", "zh": "那么……马上就用平常的方式，\n来做一次看看吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1020_024ann", "source_sha256": "5d75c4ac305821a6b9fe2b6000a8b9bd23641e6607a3844af3e8fea65a3d9346", "ja": "うん……。春香さんから習ったレシピ……\n見ながら、作るね……。えっと、まずは……。", "zh": "嗯……春香教的食谱……\n杏奈边看边做喔……杏奈看看，首先是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1021_p", "source_sha256": "648906673634752470c538253f77b50e0ab57c5fe3820df539b496beef2ac276", "ja": "（杏奈は、春香のレシピを見ながら、\n手順通りシフォンケーキを作っていく。だが……）", "zh": "（杏奈看着春香的食谱，\n按部就班地制作戚风蛋糕，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1022_024ann", "source_sha256": "fc9411cd71f140a274513c9b81da64f8d3c75b39839916cea1090c2a7486d84c", "ja": "あっ……また、失敗……。\nやっぱり……うまく、ふくらまなかった……。", "zh": "唉……又，失败……\n果然……没办法，好好膨胀……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1023_024ann", "source_sha256": "58dc3dd32f194b3daee7d4bd54d25c96235473e6a00a36451ece74b9d2b2bba7", "ja": "本当に……\n杏奈にも、作れるようになる……のかな……。", "zh": "杏奈真的……\n有办法……学会吗……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1024_p", "source_sha256": "053cb908be2d8c33b2b4e650f561619b3a6dae5ee7573f7fdaf44768910e5d1c", "ja": "（杏奈、失敗が続いているせいか、上手に作れる\nイメージが湧かないみたいだな。こういう時は……）", "zh": "（不知道是不是因为接连失败的缘故，\n杏奈似乎无法想像自己做成功的画面，这种时候……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1025_p", "source_sha256": "36a2f25557e59717d7a379578c4cf712c5117808308c57d347a6ff374682c1b8", "ja": "なあ杏奈。それならこれは、\nお菓子作りゲームだと思えばいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "我说杏奈，你要不要干脆\n把这看成制作甜点的游戏？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1026_024ann", "source_sha256": "90f7a55c35c809715ef6af085e485b8438071716dbb025378dedc75f5d99dde7", "ja": "お菓子作り、ゲーム……？", "zh": "制作甜点的游戏……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1027_p", "source_sha256": "f098b691c15f0c1b732cf9fd898b5146aea4c5194bd1cfde0f91362d27a877d4", "ja": "ああ。でも杏奈でも簡単にクリアできないなんて、\n相当、難易度の高いゲームみたいだな。", "zh": "对啊，不过就连杏奈也没办法轻松破关，\n我想这游戏的难度肯定相当高。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1028_024ann", "source_sha256": "6627708a7288a4238708f93a4df6c7b6bde0982f02b60180fec2033191fb057b", "ja": "ゲームなら、ちょっと……\nできる気、してきた……かも……。", "zh": "换成游戏的话，杏奈好像……\n有点，干劲了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1029_024ann", "source_sha256": "08017ec683603c282f8de6cb81100052376d5a092a0f9b481c71fbabfc09d52b", "ja": "{$P$}さん……\n杏奈、もう1回……やってみても、いい……？", "zh": "{$P$}先生……\n杏奈可以……再试一次吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1030_p", "source_sha256": "e17be024b0cc9f54ab11d2746a78ac9c9c55ab5291786519bfc5699335c7dcb6", "ja": "ああ、もちろんだ！　お菓子作りだって、\nいつも100％、同じ結果になるとは限らないからな！", "zh": "嗯，当然可以！制作甜点也不是每次\n都能有100%相同的成果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1031_024ann", "source_sha256": "9fd12f47afd16e858faa2d6e1e66ea9c9beef3067facddeb59909e45f77ccb02", "ja": "……うん！", "zh": "……嗯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1032_024ann", "source_sha256": "533113d4789afa1f9e7f69ec03c706ef2b1d863333450736c12a8573228e60c5", "ja": "まずは、バニラオイルで補助魔法をかけて……\n生地に……バフをかけるよ……。", "zh": "首先，使用香草油施展辅助魔法……\n然后……对面团上Buff……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1033_024ann", "source_sha256": "f3e5cb9136d017cf3c7c5b6d4aec231ceb4b2347fcf21c3ceae63e09e1c3529a", "ja": "ふんわりメレンゲ、成功……ステータス、アップ……。\nこれなら……キレイに、ふくらむかも……♪", "zh": "轻飘飘蛋白霜，成功……素质，提升……\n这样……应该能，成功膨胀起来……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1034_p", "source_sha256": "5eb860f3489d071c05a3da1f5c98d7c1850100f8ea29ffede5883495cfa79a06", "ja": "（杏奈、やっと笑顔になったな……ようやく\n成功のイメージが掴めたみたいだ。これなら……）", "zh": "（杏奈终于笑了……看来她脑中\n开始有成功的画面了，这样的话……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1035_p", "source_sha256": "037ce43e33ae782c1d7336611c141bb31219e8c93b6c8800d639e654a4c3c9b5", "ja": "（その後、練習を重ねた結果、杏奈は\n綺麗なシフォンケーキを作れるようになった！）", "zh": "（经过不断的练习，\n杏奈终于能做出漂亮的戚风蛋糕了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1036_024ann", "source_sha256": "fd05a253f948b0635f9c8331a9b0a00c0a6e2b44ad6071b8e4b16ecacbd89b50", "ja": "{$P$}さん、できたよ……♪\nこれなら……杏奈、ちゃんとできそう……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生，成功了……♪\n这样子……杏奈，应该没问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1037_p", "source_sha256": "c15f9e3b15683ef5ff74ea3ae71b735ed3c1f870ddc29a519015e14e8745dfce", "ja": "ああ。よく頑張ったな、杏奈！", "zh": "嗯，你很努力了，杏奈！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a8647076e13876739b180b72d2aa6b0060e6d69e68f652c7cbaf69e0d59432a", "ja": "うん……三奈はね、頑張り屋さんなの……。\nだから、杏奈も……頑張るね……。", "zh": "嗯……三奈是个努力的人……\n所以，杏奈……也会加油的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "1f5befbafe5b7f2dbd5bfeb3ad97bb8a6aaebddf75951b1c6913113d67e0157f", "ja": "……そうだな。えらいぞ杏奈、その調子だ！", "zh": "……说得对，杏奈很棒喔，保持这个样子！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1040_024ann", "source_sha256": "9b7f9d091bb7363c8235d9f0fc72bf74967eabaac6a4977e4a3f08288a39e81a", "ja": "はい……♪　あ、三奈は……\nお菓子だけじゃなくて、お料理も……するの……。", "zh": "好的……♪啊，三奈……\n除了甜点之外，还会……做菜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1041_024ann", "source_sha256": "5eb7270c5e127269505058f67fd621afa72a4b0d5628db2ff3ad0861c7bd8b8c", "ja": "だから、今度は……料理の練習……。\n試食、お願いします……。", "zh": "所以，接下来……要练习料理……\n再麻烦你，试吃了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1042_p", "source_sha256": "803fa82a5deef3479ac9b77885b2a921f8dcbe74ab74f7226ba6066cbc56367b", "ja": "そ、そうか……。\nわかった、最後まで付き合うよ！", "zh": "这、这样啊……\n知道了，我会一直奉陪到最后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1043_024ann", "source_sha256": "acb4a5cb92d6f0d41a8f1c2d2f4644c2a8e32290befb2550f7e4d6e35bc7ecca", "ja": "ん……ありがとう……♪\n杏奈……お料理も、がんばります……！", "zh": "嗯……谢谢你……♪\n杏奈……也会努力，学做菜的……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1044_p", "source_sha256": "e4dfb2d1b3061765ff9ea1a68ddf95d571890489e52a1eab9a2814824cb1df1a", "ja": "（正直、試食ラッシュでお腹はいっぱいだが……\nこれも杏奈のためだ）", "zh": "（老实说，接连试吃让我快撑死了……\n但这也是为了杏奈。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0054_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0054_story_04_1045_p", "source_sha256": "691f1069d6af1b9439f99af0f52ef5ad484c2c1add01224280f79eaa48ae4cbb", "ja": "（ダイエットでもしながら、\nみんなと一緒に頑張っていこう！）", "zh": "（我就一边减肥，\n一边和大家一起加油吧！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
